dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_G$\">df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (definition-target consistency sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (fixed contradiction sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的对象语言一致性句</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> : 本书固定的矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>一致性陈述断言&quot;矛盾不可证&quot;</li>\n<li>这是第二不完备性定理的对象</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>语言中的句子；外部元语言一致性写作<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>与外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>的一致，需要所选内部证明公式在标准模型中正确表示外部证明关系；二者不能仅凭相同名称互换</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_G$","text":"df-consistency-statement — Consi